WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.852
The daily CTE produces one revenue value per date
The window

00:00:05.878 --> 00:00:10.391
AVG orders those dates and uses a frame from two
preceding rows through the current

00:00:10.418 --> 00:00:16.150
row Run the query and compare the raw daily revenue
with the smoothed moving

00:00:16.163 --> 00:00:21.700
average Remember that this is a three-row window not
necessarily

00:00:21.726 --> 00:00:23.726
three calendar days if dates are missing
